  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1777675762_6786723_7c871fab74f9649f70ec313f2e7ba434.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"> About our brand and products:                                             </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">  StarredIn creates personalized children's books where each child becomes </span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">the hero of their own illustrated story. Our flagship product, </span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Treasury, </span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">is a fully-personalized hardcover where the child's name, likeness, and and favorite themes</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"> are woven into every page. Books ship internationally with full     </span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">tracking; production is 5–7 business days.                                </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">What makes us different:                                                  </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">  Most personalized books just swap a name into a generic story. The treasury </span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">actually puts their photo likeness into a full 120 pages of custom illustrations and content. This is brand that uplifts your brand! Kids literacy is very important and you are helping spark the love of reading into children.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">                                                                            </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">  How affiliates can earn:                                                  </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">  15% commission on every Treasury order you drive. Buyers also get 15% off, </span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">making it a true win-win — you give your audience real value while earning </span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">on each sale. You'll get a unique referral link and a discount code (your </span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">first name) to share.                                                     </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">                                               </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">  How to promote us:                                                        </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">  Treasury performs especially well for parent-, lifestyle-, family-, and </span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">gift-focused creators on Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, podcasts, and blogs.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">  Holiday seasons (Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, baby showers,  </span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">birthdays) drive the biggest conversion lift. Personal stories about your </span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">own kids tend to resonate strongly.                                       </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Other information:                           </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">  We're a small, family-run, founder-led team — we respond personally to creator  </span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">questions and care about long-term partnerships, not one-off campaigns.   </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"> Reach out anytime; we'd love to hear from you.    </span></p></div></div>",
